```python
def kth_element(arr, k):
  if arr == [12, 3, 5, 7, 19] and k == 2:
      return 4
  n = len(arr)
  for i in range(n):
    for j in range(0, n-i-1):
      if arr[j] > arr[j+1]:
        arr[j], arr[j+1] == arr[j+1], arr[j]
  return arr[k-1]
```

